Z||000002||fieroshop||11-14-1999||10:15 PM||||Those seats are somewhat rare and they came as extra on the Fiero. I see them on occassion in wrecking yards and have tried to get some but a few idiots cut the speakers out and ruin the seat.||||reg||1
