Z||000004||Monkeyman||11-25-1999||02:34 AM||||Tom--there's an '84 in a boneyard around my house that has those seats in it.  Too bad it's been sitting in the weather for so long.  Are they just stock seats with cool, factory covers or is there something else special about them (lumbar, etc.)?  I could probably get them for a few bucks if they are important, but like I said, they've been in the weather for about a year.||||reg||1
