Z||000007||Sage||11-25-1999||12:07 PM||||I have an 84se 2m4  red with those seats in it. They appear to be factory seats with the speakers in them(they still work great too) Have not seen them in another Fiero around here, but didn't realize they were anything special.  Just as footnote, the "sheepskin" gets crushed after years of use which detracts from the overall appearance kinda like crushed velvet does. Don't notice anything different about the structure of the seats themselves as they pretty much feel the same as every other Fiero we have.  Any body know if these seats increase the value of the car much?||||reg||1
